==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|вы-|срать}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|вы́срать}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|вы́срать|pf|impf=срать}}

# {{lb|ru|vulgar|slang}} to [[shit]] [[out]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] '''вы́срал''' [[то́нну]] [[кирпиче́й]]!|I [[shit bricks|'''shat''' a tonne of bricks]]!}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|slang|figuratively|rude}} to [[blurt out]], to [[say]] [[something]] [[out of place]] and [[irrelevant]]
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|slang|figuratively|rude}} to [[do]] [[something]] [[ridiculous]] or [[awkward]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] '''вы́срали''' [[очередной|очередну́ю]] [[хрень]] [[в]] [[свое́й]] [[газе́те]].|They '''shat out''' yet another piece of crap in their newspaper.}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|prison slang|figuratively|derogatory}} to [[give birth]] to an [[illegitimate]] [[child]] while one's [[husband]] or [[former]] [[cohabitant]] is [[serving]] a [[sentence]] in a [[corrective]] [[labour]] [[colony]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́срать''' [[выблядок|вы́блядка]]|to '''shit out''' a bastard}}

